    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single player simple blackjack game, with standard rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player plays against a computer (dealer).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains unlocks and rewards for progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game utilizes special chips as a secondary currency for unlocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable card themes and cursors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlocks include color changes to the tables, and menus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standard blackjack rules, game can be played with 1 to 10 decks at a time (with the default being 4).</p>",
